的防护性能下降了 https://t.co/sF72nYHhc8","url":"https://x.com/xzyin502/status/2111469834873569542"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111636365221969920"]},"author_id":"1832688237422505989","created_at":"2026-10-18T01:51:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111636368049033650"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/ouy3Duo7dM","end":84,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Jack_peng8964/status/2111636368049033650/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111636365221969920","start":61,"url":"https://t.co/ouy3Duo7dM"}]},"id":"2111636368049033650","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":56,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"支那中共的出生人口数量的变化， 统计数据从2000年到2025年，由此可见：猪头肉包子习近平上台后，迅速开始断崖式下跌。 https://t.co/ouy3Duo7dM","url":"https://x.com/Jack_peng8964/status/2111636368049033650"},{"author_id":"2079947345962389504","created_at":"2026-10-17T12:28:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111434097033871590"],"id":"2111434097033871590","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":45,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有个问题\n\n如果社保真的是交社保的养不交社保的这批人\n\n按照目前的出生人口情况，以后我们退休大概率也是拿不到社保的\n\n那么现在交社保还有什么意义吗？","url":"https://x.com/PeterParke5fr3/status/2111434097033871590"},{"author_id":"1131297402","created_at":"2026-10-18T14:26:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111826294371692675"],"id":"2111826294371692675","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":42,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"仮に今出生人口に合わせて賃金調整がされる会社です！会社を作ってもそれを普通としていない社会に生まれた以上ろくに人が集まらんじゃろうて","url":"https://x.com/l_sanshou_l/status/2111826294371692675"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111822236902641664"]},"author_id":"2108439078387818496","created_at":"2026-10-18T14:14:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111823250812752076"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/uVplArUBqU","end":140,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/xinge53/status/2111823250812752076/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111822236902641664","start":117,"url":"https://t.co/uVplArUBqU"}]},"id":"2111823250812752076","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":31,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天看到很多人吐槽社保，但其实现在老年人口已经1/4了，未来20年甚至去到三分之一，而且出生人口暴跌，未来将不会有足够的人口交社保，现在一代的年轻人根本没有机会享受现在质量的退休金。所以可以理解为老登们用画饼抢走了年轻人的钱来养老。 https://t.co/uVplArUBqU","url":"https://x.com/xinge53/status/2111823250812752076"},{"author_id":"1549716930378219520","created_at":"2026-10-17T04:49:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111318556826820637"],"id":"2111318556826820637","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":54,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我妈说像我这样不结婚，不生孩子，老了以后在养老院会被护工打。\n\n我大概算了一下现在的出生人口，等我住进养老院的时候，一个护工每天要照顾五六十个老人。\n\n就算他上午打一个，下午打一个，也要一个月才能轮到我。\n\n一个月被打一次，我觉得还总体能接受。万一还是个小姑娘，那就更舒服了。","url":"https://x.com/Veritas135/status/2111318556826820637"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111255781651718144","3_2111255781643374592","3_2111255781584637953","3_2111255781676851201"]},"author_id":"203213759","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:40:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111255900539208145"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Zao7WuJeRA","end":154,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/fuxianyi/status/2111255900539208145/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111255781651718144","start":131,"url":"https://t.co/Zao7WuJeRA"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Zao7WuJeRA","end":154,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/fuxianyi/status/2111255900539208145/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111255781643374592","start":131,"url":"https://t.co/Zao7WuJeRA"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Zao7WuJeRA","end":154,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/fuxianyi/status/2111255900539208145/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111255781584637953","start":131,"url":"https://t.co/Zao7WuJeRA"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Zao7WuJeRA","end":154,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/fuxianyi/status/2111255900539208145/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111255781676851201","start":131,"url":"https://t.co/Zao7WuJeRA"}]},"id":"2111255900539208145","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":347,"impression_count":148075,"like_count":928,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":46,"retweet_count":62},"text":"几年前，我曾利用卡介苗批签发量质疑中国官方出生数。有人撰文反驳说，不能用卡介苗批签发量推算出生数。最近，《华尔街日报》专题报道了我的四万多字研究专辑，并引用了我利用卡介苗数据质疑官方出生人口数据的分析。有人又引用那篇文章指责我。我说明一下为什么可用卡介苗数据。 https://t.co/Zao7WuJeRA","url":"https://x.com/fuxianyi/status/2111255900539208145"},{"author_id":"1599631018679742464","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:12:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111248943094898854"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/Hardison0910/s…","end":174,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/Hardison0910/status/2111246817501528161","start":151,"url":"https://t.co/NYCk4PcIxy"}]},"id":"2111248943094898854","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":381,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"孩子受教育\n是家庭教育与学校教育\n共同作用\n做人做事的道理\n主要依赖家庭教育\n因材施教，根据每个孩子的特长\n挑选适合孩子的教材和方式\n这是父母的权利，也是责任\n学校教育只能按流水线培养\n不培养，不鼓励，有什么特长\n700万出生人口，1200万大学招生\n缺口500万\n专才，特才\n必然是未来教育发展趋势 https://t.co/NYCk4PcIxy","url":"https://x.com/Hardison0910/status/2111248943094898854"},{"author_id":"1745479631900233728","created_at":"2026-10-18T14:38:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111829363150967273"],"id":"2111829363150967273","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"一天到晚嫌出生人口不多，扣扣搜搜的每个月给三百还只给三年。\n\n真想鼓励生育很简单，给全职妇女生一个孩子交五年社保，生两个孩子交12年，生三个孩子交20年社保，确保每个全职生育妇女能有退休保障，同时出生的孩子0到18岁国家给缴纳城乡居民医保，免费午餐。\n\n就光这两点，看看出生率能不能上去。","url":"https://x.com/bu_jiajia43910/status/2111829363150967273"},{"author_id":"69071506","created_at":"2026-10-18T15:49:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111847093942059397"],"id":"2111847093942059397","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":258,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"古人都知道，捕鱼不能竭泽而渔，要留点鱼苗，休养生息。\n\n2025年，中国出生人口只剩792万，出生率跌至5.63‰，人口连续负增长。\n\n年轻人不敢结婚、不敢生娃，生活压力已经够大了。\n\n可即便如此，社保缴纳还在不断强化，想多留点工资在手里都难。\n\n古人尚且知道不能把鱼捞绝了。","url":"https://x.com/MgSevenxx/status/2111847093942059397"},{"author_id":"1722347682830635008","created_at":"2026-10-17T16:29:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111494934276538428"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/ChineseWSJ/sta…","end":164,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/ChineseWSJ/status/2111442130036002953","start":141,"url":"https://t.co/SUxUFaPG0p"}]},"id":"2111494934276538428","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":162,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"华尔街日报日文网的文章水平真是不敢恭维。首先，易富贤的人口估计值是一个模型计算结果，用一个模型预测值去否定实际人口统计值，违背基本的科学原则，需要重大而确凿的证据证明中国的人口统计数据出现重大差错。而这一点，易富贤没有证明，也几乎没有任何人或机构提供了可靠的证明。其次，即便以易富 https://t.co/SUxUFaPG0p","url":"https://x.com/kongdingji/status/2111494934276538428"},{"article":{"title":"同一道变态考题：DeepSeek 30分钟交卷，Gemini还在转圈"},"author_id":"1956780447502856192","created_at":"2026-10-18T07:45:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111725356994461825"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2111…","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2111720558912049153","start":0,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2111720558912049153","url":"https://t.co/Sd0DQvon0j"}]},"id":"2111725356994461825","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":31,"like_count":0,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/Sd0DQvon0j","url":"https://x.com/ver_suting/status/2111725356994461825"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111624854223089665","3_2111624860590084096"]},"author_id":"1530406379898695680","created_at":"2026-10-18T01:06:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111624865795252463"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/2PrUmkoc9v","end":187,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/pac8Mak1r/status/2111624865795252463/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111624854223089665","start":164,"url":"https://t.co/2PrUmkoc9v"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/2PrUmkoc9v","end":187,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/pac8Mak1r/status/2111624865795252463/pho